  "description": "Playing Wordscapes 10 mins a day sharpens your mind and prepares you for your daily life and challenges! \n\nThis text twist of a word game is tremendous brain challenging fun. Enjoy modern word puzzles with word searching, anagrams, and crosswords! Immerse yourself into the beautiful scenery backgrounds to relax and ease your mind.\n\nNow available in 5 languages! Enjoy the Wordscapes experience in English, Spanish, German, French, and Portuguese. Challenge yourself to connect letters and find as many hidden words as you can in relaxing games! Unlock stunning landscape backgrounds to escape from home and relax your brain.\n\nYouΓÇÖll never experience a dull moment after you try this word puzzle game! Play this crossword puzzle once and you wonΓÇÖt be able to put it down. Enjoy word connect and word find games? This is your final destination!\n\nΓû║Escape and play relaxing games while visiting the beautiful destinations of Wordscapes!\nΓû║ Show your vocabulary power by connecting letters and finding all the hidden words.\nΓû║ Get your word hunt on with over 6,000 crossword puzzles!\nΓû║ Challenge your brain and vocabulary ΓÇô this crossword puzzle starts easy and becomes challenging fast!\nΓû║ Think you can beat these anagram word puzzles? They start simply but ramp up fast!\nΓû║ Take each level at your own pace with unlimited tries. Simply fun and relaxation!\n\nWordscapes is the word puzzle game for adults that over 10 million people just can't stop playing! It's a great fit for fans of crossword, word connect, spelling games, and word anagram games, combining word find games and crossword puzzles. Not to mention our relaxing games have  gorgeous landscapes to visit!\nLooking for a break that still feels productive? These brain games offer just that! Wordscapes is a great puzzle game for adults who love words and beautiful visuals.\nIf you're looking for brain games that arenΓÇÖt stressful, Wordscapes is a great pick. ItΓÇÖs smart, satisfying, and one of the most calming puzzle games for adults youΓÇÖll find.\nWordscapes gives you that ΓÇ£just one more levelΓÇ¥ feeling. ItΓÇÖs no surprise itΓÇÖs a favorite among brain games \nand a go-to choice for fans of puzzle games for adults\nWordscapes an exciting word puzzle game thatΓÇÖs easy to pick up and hard to put down. With calming visuals and clever levels, itΓÇÖs a refreshing way to unwind while keeping your mind young.\nTerms of service: https://www.peoplefun.com/terms",
